Package: sisura-install
Version: 0.1.0
Architecture: @SISURA_ARCH@
Maintainer: Sisura Maintainers <packages@sisura.invalid>
Section: admin
Priority: optional
Depends: libc6, util-linux, fdisk, dosfstools, e2fsprogs, cryptsetup, cryptsetup-initramfs, tar, udev
Description: Sisura Linux installer
 Installs Sisura from the live ISO to a disk: GPT with an EFI system
 partition, an unencrypted /boot and a LUKS2-encrypted root, GRUB for UEFI.
 Run: sudo sisura-install disks; sudo sisura-install install --disk <disk>
 .
 Removed from the installed system by the installer itself.
